OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find the
OL,7,Fdetails in this report upsetting
OL,9,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,10,Fmurdering two homeless men whose
OL,11,Fbodies were dismembered and hidden in
OL,12,Fwoodland.
OL,14,FJames Desborough, 40, was found guilty
OL,15,Fby a jury at Winchester Crown Court of
OL,16,Fkilling Claudio Aquilino, 57, and
OL,17,FDaniel Coleman, 43, last year in
OL,18,FCornwall.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
