OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FThe former builder is already serving
OL,7,Fa life sentence after he strangled his
OL,8,Fprison cellmate Steven Kempster at HMP
OL,9,FExeter while on remand awaiting this
OL,10,Ftrial.
OL,12,FThe triple murderer is now a serial
OL,13,Fkiller having killed three men in
OL,14,Fseparate incidents over five months.
OL,16,FA jury at Winchester Crown Court
OL,17,Freturned the unanimous guilty verdicts
OL,18,Fon Tuesday 28 July after deliberating
OL,19,Ffor three hours and 15 minutes.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FDesborough showed no emotion as the
OL,7,Fverdicts were read out.
OL,9,FThe trial heard Mr Aquilino and Mr
OL,10,FColeman had previously lived with
OL,11,FDesborough at a homeless hostel, and
OL,12,Fthe last time they were both seen
OL,13,Falive was in his company.
OL,15,FAfter their disappearances, the
OL,16,Fpowerfully-built Desborough, who is
OL,17,F5ft 10in and weighs nearly 18st, went
OL,18,Fon to spend their money on drugs and
OL,19,Falcohol.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FTheir bodies were dismembered in an
OL,7,Farea of Sticker Woods, near St
OL,8,FAustell, where Desborough lived in a
OL,9,Fwooden cabin.
OL,11,FIt was there that police discovered
OL,12,Fdeposited in a stream 1,900 burned
OL,13,Fbone fragments from the body of Mr
OL,14,FAquilino.
OL,16,FParts of Mr Coleman's body, including
OL,17,Fhis torso, legs and feet, were found
OL,18,Fin a shallow grave nearby.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FDesborough told a forensic biologist
OL,7,Fwho was searching the woods for Mr
OL,8,FColeman's body that he "particularly
OL,9,Fenjoyed the dismemberment scenes" in
OL,10,Fthe television series Dexter.
OL,12,FPolice found several handwritten notes
OL,13,Finside Desborough's cabin, including
OL,14,Fone headed: "Bug out list" and
OL,15,Fanother: "Hostiles".
OL,26,@pD@XOUqD@aO]vD@MOUvD@ZO]wD@JOUwD@SO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FAmong the notes were one which said:
OL,7,F"I know I am a killer and ready to
OL,8,Fexecute any predators" and another
OL,9,Fthat said: "Take care of the remaining
OL,10,Fmuppets," with Mr Coleman's name also
OL,11,Flisted.
OL,13,FDesborough also drew a series of
OL,14,Fconcentric circles with Sticker Woods
OL,15,Fin the centre, and London and Benidorm
OL,16,Flisted at the outer point, which was
OL,17,Fentitled: "Kill Zone", and the sub-
OL,18,Fheading: "Operational spheres".
OL,20,FHe had also made plans to the leave
OL,21,Fthe UK weeks before he was arrested.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@VO]qD@LOUrD@IO]yD@KOUyD@UO]zD@
OL,26,AJOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FThe father-of-one denied both murders
OL,7,Fand told the jury it was a "series of
OL,8,Funfortunate circumstances" the two men
OL,9,Fdied on his land within a short space
OL,10,Fof time.
OL,12,FDesborough killed Mr Aquilino, who had
OL,13,Faddictions to drugs and gambling,
OL,14,Fshortly after he was last seen alive
OL,15,Fin April last year.
OL,17,FThe defendant maintained he had in
OL,18,Ffact while high on ketamine found Mr
OL,19,FAquilino, who had a history of
OL,20,Fsuicidal ideation, hanging dead from a
OL,21,Ftree on his land in May or early June.
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FAnd his role was helping Mr Coleman `
OL,7,Fwho had dismembered and burnt the
OL,8,Fremains alone ` dispose of Mr
OL,9,FAquilino's body in a stream,
OL,10,FDesborough said.
OL,12,FHe said Mr Coleman calmed him down and
OL,13,Fconvinced him to dispose of the body
OL,14,Fand carry on using Mr Aquilino's bank
OL,15,Fcard.
OL,17,F"The idea was to cover up the death,
OL,18,Fcarry on using his card. I'm not proud
OL,19,Fof it, it was like dangling the
OL,20,Fcarrot," he said.
OL,26,@yD@AOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,F"I was homeless, jobless, I had no
OL,7,Fmoney and addiction problems."
OL,9,FHe also denied murdering Mr Coleman in
OL,10,Fthe early hours of 4 June, and instead
OL,11,Finsisted he had returned to his cabin
OL,12,Flater that month and found him lying
OL,13,Fface down and dead in a stream.
OL,15,FWorried about there already being one
OL,16,Fdead body on his land and that he was
OL,17,Fin possession of Class A drugs, he
OL,18,Fdismembered Mr Coleman using an axe
OL,19,Fand buried the remains.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FHe accepted then spending their money
OL,7,Fon beer and drugs, but told jurors:
OL,8,F"They were friends, I got on well with
OL,9,Fthem."
OL,11,FFamily members of Daniel Coleman were
OL,12,Foutside court after the verdict was
OL,13,Fdelivered on Tuesday. They told ITV
OL,14,FNews they believed the vulnerabilities
OL,15,Fof both victims were "taken advantage
OL,16,Fof" by Desborough.
OL,18,F"The thing I've heard have made my
OL,19,Ftoes curl, my stomach churn, but
OL,20,Fjustice has been done", said Rebecca
OL,21,FNye.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@FO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,F"I don't think you're a normal human
OL,7,Fbeing if you can do that for someone
OL,8,Felse", said Paul Nye, the brother of
OL,9,FDaniel Coleman.
OL,11,FAsked what their message would be for
OL,12,FDesborough, who is due to be sentenced
OL,13,Fon Wednesday 29 July, Tony Nye, Daniel
OL,14,FColeman's brother said: "Rot in hell".
OL,16,F"I hope you're happy with what you've
OL,17,Fdone but you will now forever be on
OL,18,Fyour own", Rebecca added.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/12
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
