FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785339678
OL,3,CMan guilty of murdering two men found
OL,4,Cin Cornwall woodland
OL,6,FDesborough, of Old Oak Woods, Lower
OL,7,FSticker, Cornwall, had previously
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to preventing the
OL,9,Flawful burial of the two men's bodies.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/12
